%% T-10: scale-out — owner-per-doc over Redis pub/sub.
%% Update when: ownership claims, channels, or OpRouter flow changes.
sequenceDiagram
    participant CA as Client A (→ inst. 1)
    participant I1 as Instance 1 (non-owner)
    participant R as Redis pub/sub
    participant I2 as Instance 2 (OWNER)
    participant CB as Client B (→ inst. 2)

    Note over I2: claimed doc:{id}:owner SET NX (TTL 15s, renewed 5s)

    CA->>I1: SubmitOp
    I1->>R: PUBLISH doc:{id}:in (op)
    I1-->>CA: ack seq=-1 "forwarded"
    R->>I2: inbox → OpRouter
    I2->>I2: Room.Submit → seq=N, journal
    I2->>R: PUBLISH doc:{id}:out (broadcast)
    R->>I1: :out → hub.Clients.Group
    R->>I2: :out → hub.Clients.Group
    I1-->>CA: op seq=N (echo reconciles optimistic)
    I2-->>CB: op seq=N

    Note over CA,I2: ordering point = owner's Room lock.<br/>Split-brain possible: advisory claim,<br/>no fencing — journal is merge witness.
